{
  "name": "Day 43 Solution: Advanced AI Agent Patterns",
  "description": "Hierarchical multi-agent orchestration system: a master agent (OpenAI) plans work, the plan is persisted for real to Airtable and posted to Slack, then a second OpenAI call synthesizes the final report which is logged to Airtable and posted to Slack.",
  "tags": [
    "week-07",
    "ai-agents",
    "day-43",
    "orchestration",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 43 Solution: Advanced AI Agent Patterns\n\nA master agent (OpenAI) plans work for four worker roles, then the plan is persisted for real: an Airtable record is created and a Slack message is posted. A second OpenAI call synthesizes the final report from the plan and those real confirmations, and the report is logged to Airtable and posted to Slack.\n\n**What changed from the audited version:** the four fake \"Deploy Agent\" HTTP calls to `api.agent-deployer.com` and the two fake \"send/log\" calls to `api.advanced-agent-service.com` / `api.advanced-agent-log.com` are gone. In their place: two real Airtable nodes (create records) and two real Slack nodes (post message). All OpenAI response references were fixed to the correct `message.content` shape n8n's OpenAI node actually returns (the audited version wrongly read `choices[0].message.content`).\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key (both openAi nodes); Airtable Personal Access Token (both airtable nodes — set your own base/table); Slack OAuth2 (both slack nodes — set your own channel).\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_43_Advanced_AI_Agent_Patterns.md for the full lesson this solves.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "advanced-ai-agent-orchestrator",
      "name": "Advanced AI Agent Orchestrator",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "advanced-ai-agent",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "initialize-advanced-agent-system",
      "name": "Initialize Advanced Agent System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "agent_system_id",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyyMMddHHmmss') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "system_type",
              "value": "advanced_multi_agent"
            },
            {
              "name": "start_time",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "agent_hierarchy",
              "value": "={{ { \"master\": \"orchestrator\", \"workers\": [\"research_agent\", \"analysis_agent\", \"communication_agent\", \"decision_agent\"] } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "process-complex-request",
      "name": "Process Complex Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "complex_request",
              "value": "={{ $json.request || 'Analyze market trends, research competitors, and provide strategic recommendations for AI automation business.' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "request_complexity",
              "value": "high"
            },
            {
              "name": "required_agents",
              "value": "={{ ['research_agent', 'analysis_agent', 'communication_agent', 'decision_agent'] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "priority_level",
              "value": "critical"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "master-agent-analysis",
      "name": "Master Agent Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a master AI agent orchestrator that analyzes complex requests and coordinates multiple specialized agents. You determine task distribution, agent coordination, and result synthesis."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Complex Request: ' + $json.complex_request + '\\n\\nRequired Agents: ' + $json.required_agents.join(', ') + '\\n\\nCreate a detailed execution plan and task distribution strategy.' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokens": 600
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-plan-to-airtable",
      "name": "Log Plan to Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "agent_plans",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "agent_system_id": "={{ $('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.agent_system_id }}",
            "complex_request": "={{ $('Process Complex Request').item.json.complex_request }}",
            "master_agent_plan": "={{ $json.message.content }}",
            "created_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "post-plan-to-slack",
      "name": "Post Plan to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_channel_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "={{ '📋 New agent system plan (' + $('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.agent_system_id + ')\\n\\nRequest: ' + $('Process Complex Request').item.json.complex_request + '\\n\\nPlan:\\n' + $json.message.content }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-real-persistence",
      "name": "Real Persistence Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Real, testable persistence\n\nThese two nodes replace the four fake \"Deploy Agent\" calls to `api.agent-deployer.com`. They actually run: an Airtable record is created with the plan, and a Slack message is posted with it. Set your own Airtable base/table and Slack channel after import.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "merge-plan-persistence",
      "name": "Merge Plan Persistence",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByPosition",
        "numberInputs": 2,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "collect-agent-results",
      "name": "Collect Agent Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "agent_system_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.agent_system_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "complex_request",
              "value": "={{ $('Process Complex Request').item.json.complex_request }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "master_agent_plan",
              "value": "={{ $('Master Agent Analysis').item.json.message.content }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "airtable_record_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Log Plan to Airtable').item.json.id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "slack_message_ts",
              "value": "={{ $('Post Plan to Slack').item.json.ts }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "master-agent-synthesis",
      "name": "Master Agent Synthesis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1920,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a master AI agent that synthesizes a coordination plan into one comprehensive, integrated solution for the original requester."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Original Request: ' + $json.complex_request + '\\n\\nMaster Plan:\\n' + $json.master_agent_plan + '\\n\\nThe plan has been persisted (Airtable record ' + $json.airtable_record_id + ', Slack message ' + $json.slack_message_ts + '). Provide a comprehensive synthesis and final recommendations.' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 1000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-advanced-agent-report",
      "name": "Generate Advanced Agent Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        2160,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "advanced_agent_report",
              "value": "={{ { \"agent_system_id\": $('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.agent_system_id, \"system_type\": $('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.system_type, \"start_time\": $('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.start_time, \"complex_request\": $('Process Complex Request').item.json.complex_request, \"request_complexity\": $('Process Complex Request').item.json.request_complexity, \"required_agents\": $('Process Complex Request').item.json.required_agents, \"agent_hierarchy\": $('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.agent_hierarchy, \"master_agent_plan\": $('Collect Agent Results').item.json.master_agent_plan, \"airtable_record_id\": $('Collect Agent Results').item.json.airtable_record_id, \"slack_message_ts\": $('Collect Agent Results').item.json.slack_message_ts, \"master_synthesis\": $json.message.content, \"processing_time\": $now.diff($('Initialize Advanced Agent System').item.json.start_time, 'milliseconds'), \"completed_at\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "success_message",
              "value": "✅ Advanced AI agent system processing completed successfully"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-final-report-to-airtable",
      "name": "Log Final Report to Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2400,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "agent_reports",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "agent_system_id": "={{ $json.advanced_agent_report.agent_system_id }}",
            "master_synthesis": "={{ $json.advanced_agent_report.master_synthesis }}",
            "completed_at": "={{ $json.advanced_agent_report.completed_at }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "post-synthesis-to-slack",
      "name": "Post Synthesis to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2400,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_channel_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "={{ '✅ Agent system ' + $('Generate Advanced Agent Report').item.json.advanced_agent_report.agent_system_id + ' complete.\\n\\nFinal synthesis:\\n' + $('Generate Advanced Agent Report').item.json.advanced_agent_report.master_synthesis }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-real-services-2",
      "name": "Real Services Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2400,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Real, testable persistence\n\nThese two nodes replace the fake \"Send Advanced Agent Results\" and \"Log Advanced Agent Activity\" calls to `api.advanced-agent-service.com` / `api.advanced-agent-log.com`. They actually run.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "handle-advanced-agent-error",
      "name": "Handle Advanced Agent Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "advanced_agent_error",
              "value": "={{ { \"error_type\": \"advanced_agent_failed\", \"agent_system_id\": $json.agent_system_id, \"message\": \"Advanced AI agent system failed\", \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "error_response",
              "value": "={{ { \"status\": \"error\", \"agent_system_id\": $json.agent_system_id, \"message\": \"Advanced AI agent workflow error\" } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
